```

contains:

```text
salary.xlsx
taxes.txt
budget.txt
```

We might want:

```text
Finance team → Full access
Other employees → No access
```

Linux permissions can help implement this.

For example:

```text
drwxrwx--- finance
```

This means:

```text
Owner  → rwx
Group  → rwx
Others → ---
```

If the finance users belong to the finance group, they can access the directory while others cannot.

