```

Now Alice becomes the owner.

---

# 📌 14. Changing Owner and Group

You can change both:

```bash
sudo chown alice:developers report.txt
```

Meaning:

```text
Owner → alice
Group → developers
```

Check:

```bash
ls -l report.txt
```

---

# 📌 15. Changing Only the Group

Use:

```bash
chgrp
```

Example:

```bash
sudo chgrp developers report.txt
```

Now the group ownership changes to:

```text
